    "description": "Elegant Inner Richmond Edwardian! A handsome wood-shingle faade introduces an interior that gracefully blends timeless detail with modern upgrades. The gracious wainscoted entry leads to a sunlit open living room with a charming window bench, abundant natural light, and a gas fireplace with marble surround. The sophisticated dining room showcases box-beam ceilings, intricate moldings, wood paneling, hardwood floors, and a built-in china cabinet. A recently remodeled chef's kitchen with quartz countertops, stylish backsplash, and deluxe stainless appliances opens directly to a large wraparound deck, ideal for BBQing and entertaining, with stairs down to a grassy, manicured lawn and palm tree. Upstairs are 3 bedrooms and 2 baths, including a generous primary suite with a wall of closets and an updated ensuite bath with colorful glass tile shower. Two more bedrooms enjoy great light and ample closets, sharing an attractive hall bath with a shower over tub. In-unit laundry and a spacious unfinished attic add convenience and storage. The lower level offers a versatile office and flex room with direct garden access, a roomy one-car garage, add'l storage and 2 off-street parking spaces. Just 3 blocks from Golden Gate Park and 2 blocks from Clement Street's fantastic shops and dining."
  },
